","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2022-04-20T12:40:15Z","updated_at":"2022-04-20T12:40:55Z","body":"@andrewlewis do you now if we can make a _safe_ guess on the number of channels if the information is missing from `Format` for those audio formats for which the player does audio passthrough? In this issue it's DTS, but I think the same problem may apply for the other audio encodings too. With HLS chunkless preparation, we cannot know the channel count from the playlist., hence `Format.channelCount` is not set.\r\n\r\nFor example, could `DefaultAudioSink` do something similar as in the ENCODING_E_AC3_JOC case ([link](https://github.com/google/ExoPlayer/blob/8129675b065bc98330ec775fb7a538c139793070/library/core/src/main/java/com/google/android/exoplayer2/audio/DefaultAudioSink.java#L1728-L1744))?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/1103885438/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"christosts","id":54315740,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0MzE1NzQw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54315740?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/christosts","html_url":"https://github.com/christosts","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/christosts/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/christosts/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/christosts/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/christosts/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/christosts/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/christosts/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/christosts/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/christosts/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/christosts/received_events"